{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261116/photo/bkn-20261116141052719-1116_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261116141948\"/><p>私家車剷上路中石壆。</p><p>九龍塘發生交通意外。今午(16日)1時57分，一輛私家車及一輛客貨車沿窩打老道往旺角方向行駛，至近對衡道對開時兩車首尾相撞，私家車被撞剷上路中石壆，車身向左傾側擱在石壆上。事件中一名女子受傷清醒由救護車送院治理，意外原因有待警員調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T06:33:48.154986+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T06:10:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T06:47:47.761495+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T06:27:05.248811+00:00","content_hash":"88262dad02f7f0081267e8f7b2d462b9751a549e03fead20757735b508bcce51","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}